\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] to make PPPROPs without a PROsubject (closed PPPROPs). 
In generation, all incoming PPFORMULAs have a free choice between this 
transformation and the following one, which makes open PPPROPs.
